@startuml 05-activity-validation-and-upsert
' Colours via style classes, not <<#colour>>: older PlantUML (1.2024.3, bundled with the VS Code extension) rejects that form.
<style>
activityDiagram {
  .fail { BackGroundColor pink }
  .ok { BackGroundColor palegreen }
}
</style>
title Validation and version-guarded write (inside one transaction)

start
:Receive TradeSubmission\n(tradeId, version, counterPartyId, bookId, maturityDate as raw values);
:today = LocalDate.now(clock)  (configured zone, US-205);
:stored = findById(tradeId)\n(skipped if tradeId is not a usable ID: blank, over 64 characters, control characters; A-55);
:attempt = 1;

repeat
  :Run ALL validators and collect violations (A-15);
  note right
    **MandatoryFieldsValidator**: tradeId, counterPartyId, bookId not blank → INVALID_FIELD
    **PositiveVersionValidator**: version present and ≥ 1 → INVALID_FIELD
    **MaturityDateFormatValidator**: present and strict yyyy-MM-dd → INVALID_FIELD
    **LowerVersionValidator**: if stored and version valid: version < stored.version → LOWER_VERSION
    **MaturityNotInPastValidator**: if date parses: maturity < today → MATURITY_IN_PAST
    Each validator skips checks whose inputs are invalid, so
    one bad field never causes a misleading second reason.
  end note
  if (any violations?) then (yes)
    :append REJECTED outbox event with ALL reasons;
    :commit;
    if (LOWER_VERSION among reasons?) then (yes)
      :throw LowerVersionException\n(carries every reason; US-104.4, US-201.4); <<fail>>
    else (no)
      :throw TradeRejectedException; <<fail>>
    endif
    stop
  endif
  :upsertIfNotOlder(Trade.newVersion(...))\nINSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE WHERE stored.version <= new.version;
  if (row written?) then (yes)
    if (inserted? (xmax = 0)) then (yes)
      :outcome = ACCEPTED;
    else (no)
      :outcome = REPLACED;
    endif
    :append ACCEPTED/REPLACED outbox event;
    :commit;
    :return IngestionResult(outcome, trade); <<ok>>
    stop
  endif
  :STALE: a higher version was committed concurrently (US-106);
  :stored = findById(tradeId) (re-read);
  :attempt = attempt + 1;
repeat while (attempt <= 2?) is (yes: re-validate, US-106.2)
-> no;
:append REJECTED (LOWER_VERSION) outbox event;
:commit;
:throw LowerVersionException; <<fail>>
stop

@enduml
